{"ref":"BDB Aramaic, נְסַךְ","hw":"נְסַךְ","html":"† <big><big><span dir=\"rtl\">נְסַךְ</span></big></big>  <strong>vb. pour out (</strong>v. BH <a data-ref=\"BDB, נָסַךְ\" href=\"/BDB,_נָסַךְ\", dir=\"rtl\">I. נָסַךְ</a><strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>Pa.</strong>  (more gen.): Inf. <span dir=\"rtl\">לְנַסָּכָה לֵהּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:46\" href=\"/Daniel.2.46\">Dn 2:46</a> <em>to offer in sacrifice to him</em>, c. acc. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִנְחָה וְנִיחֹחִין</span>.","next":"BDB Aramaic, נְסַךְ²","prev":"BDB Aramaic, נְסַח"}